\section{Designs and centering}{

\itemize{
\item \code{"topcross"}: every candidate crossed to every tester; GCA over candidates.
\item \code{"factorial"}: the same crosses (North Carolina Design II), with GCA reported
for candidates and for testers.
\item \code{"diallel"}: every unordered pair of distinct candidates (\code{testers} unused;
